-- TiDB SQL editor version. Numbered 0274.
-- Faircrest Cabinets Product Specification Guide, November 2026 Edition
-- (Clark & Son Inc.). Updates kitchen, tall, and accessory cabinet facts
-- and the printed RTA list prices. Does not delete or rename a master code.
-- Does not change vanity, ADA, or toilet rows. Does not change return,
-- warranty, or terms text. Does not change Auto Design layout rules.
-- Paste each numbered block on its own. One statement per block where noted.
-- Every table is cabinet_dealz.<table>.

-- 1. Read-only: Faircrest door styles before the edition update.
SELECT faircrest_style.id, faircrest_style.styleCode, faircrest_style.ourName, faircrest_style.doorStyle
FROM cabinet_dealz.door_styles AS faircrest_style
WHERE faircrest_style.distributorId = 210001
ORDER BY faircrest_style.styleCode;

